WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:03.128
-Trying to sneak up on me?
-Maybe.

00:00:05.255 --> 00:00:06.715
You're a badass.

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:10.427
I will never choose
to be with you.

00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:12.304
Wait, you wanna go
inside my head?

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:20.771
What's up? I'm Gabe.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.024
Kraft service?

00:00:24.983 --> 00:00:27.402
Oh, yeah, sorry.
Gabe is new to Matheson too.

00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:29.363
We were on a frantic search
for our monster,

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:30.739
so we offered him friendship

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:32.157
in exchange
for wearing a suit

00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:33.200
that doesn't breathe.

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:35.118
It does not
smell awesome in here.

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:36.411
You're a badass.

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.414
I don't feel like a badass.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.043
I like this, Kinsey.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.267
What does my family have

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.935
no one else
in the world does?

00:01:00.018 --> 00:01:01.270
Like 19 chimneys.

00:01:01.854 --> 00:01:02.688
No.

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:06.900
Oh, you mean
like magical keys?

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:07.818
Yeah.

00:01:08.652 --> 00:01:11.071
How did they--
I mean, I, I thought that

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:12.739
hardly anyone
knew about those?

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.785
That may be a story
for another day.

00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:19.413
Your secret's safe with me,
I hope you know that.

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:21.999
-I do.
-Hey!

00:01:24.293 --> 00:01:26.879
Welcome to the upper class.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.467
-You're in a good mood.
-Why wouldn't I be?

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:33.719
We're juniors now

00:01:33.802 --> 00:01:35.470
and we got
a partial standing ovation

00:01:35.554 --> 00:01:36.972
for premiering
what has gotta be

00:01:37.055 --> 00:01:39.183
the second best
lobster movie of all time.

00:01:39.266 --> 00:01:40.350
What's the first best?

00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:41.935
The lobster.

00:01:42.019 --> 00:01:43.854
There aren't any lobsters
in that movie.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.522
Okay, so then we win!

00:01:45.606 --> 00:01:46.523
And to celebrate,

00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:50.194
I got us dinner reservations
for tonight at Stan's Pizza.

00:01:50.277 --> 00:01:52.404
I didn't know Stan's
even took reservations.

00:01:52.487 --> 00:01:54.615
Usually they don't,
but they made an exception

00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:56.491
for a high roller
such as myself.

00:01:56.575 --> 00:01:58.202
Know that sticky table
next to the dart board?

00:01:58.285 --> 00:01:59.620
-That's all ours.
-Oh.

00:01:59.703 --> 00:02:01.121
How could a girl
say no to that?

00:02:01.205 --> 00:02:02.164
Speaking of,

00:02:02.247 --> 00:02:04.041
do you ever think about,

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:06.126
you know,
how the keys were made?

00:02:06.210 --> 00:02:07.586
Where they came from?

00:02:07.669 --> 00:02:09.421
I told you
my ancestors made them.

00:02:09.505 --> 00:02:11.048
I know,
but maybe you inherited

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:12.466
some sense of how to do it?

00:02:13.717 --> 00:02:14.927
How to make new keys?

00:02:16.386 --> 00:02:17.971
How to melt down metal

00:02:18.055 --> 00:02:20.140
and somehow infuse it
with magical power?

00:02:21.308 --> 00:02:22.643
I don't think so. Sorry.

00:02:22.726 --> 00:02:25.395
I'm pretty curious
about your family too.

00:02:25.479 --> 00:02:27.105
My family?
Have a special connection

00:02:27.189 --> 00:02:28.607
to being really boring.

00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:39.159
You feel
like you know me, right?

00:02:40.494 --> 00:02:41.328
Sure.

00:02:42.746 --> 00:02:43.580
Wait, it's, um...

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:47.292
uh, it's Kinsey, right?

00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:48.669
I'm serious.

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.677
Wait, you wanna go
inside my head?

00:02:59.012 --> 00:02:59.847
Uh...

00:03:01.974 --> 00:03:04.101
I, uh, I dunno, Kinsey.
That's kinda...

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.186
I dunno. It-it's probably
a mess up there.

00:03:06.687 --> 00:03:09.064
I don't care. Whatever it is
it's part of you.

00:03:09.147 --> 00:03:10.357
It's nothing personal.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:11.859
Don't think
I'm ready for that.

00:03:11.942 --> 00:03:13.277
How could this
not be personal?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:15.153
Because it's,
it's not about you.

00:03:15.237 --> 00:03:17.364
Gabe, I promise.
I would never judge you--

00:03:17.447 --> 00:03:18.740
No! No! Just drop it!

00:03:23.412 --> 00:03:24.246
Sure.

00:03:25.664 --> 00:03:28.208
Hmm, trouble in paradise?

00:03:30.127 --> 00:03:31.211
Shut up, Eden.

00:03:33.463 --> 00:03:34.965
She doesn't know how
to make keys.

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:35.924
Ah...

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:37.718
that's too bad.

00:03:38.677 --> 00:03:40.512
Oh, silver lining.
We can kill her now.

00:03:40.596 --> 00:03:41.597
No.

00:03:42.806 --> 00:03:43.849
Chill.

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:45.767
Oh, shit.

00:03:45.851 --> 00:03:47.561
He knows
that you made a key.

00:03:49.396 --> 00:03:51.565
It's why he cares so much
about fixing you.

00:03:51.648 --> 00:03:53.901
Why's he not making a grab
for me right now?

00:03:53.984 --> 00:03:54.985
Because I lied to him.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.780
He doesn't know you've had
your memory restored.

00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:02.242
And we have to keep it
that way.

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:04.536
Until we can
come up with a plan.

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.426
Gabe!

00:04:20.093 --> 00:04:21.261
What're you doing here?

00:04:21.345 --> 00:04:23.680
You know, I just,
I left my bike here

00:04:23.764 --> 00:04:25.516
and so I thought
I'd just check in.

00:04:25.599 --> 00:04:27.267
how's Duncan?
Does he remember?

00:04:28.435 --> 00:04:29.603
No.

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:31.480
We tried the key,
but it didn't work.

00:04:33.774 --> 00:04:34.608
What happened?

00:04:35.776 --> 00:04:36.610
Is he okay?

00:04:37.236 --> 00:04:38.820
Uh, no. not at all.

00:04:39.655 --> 00:04:40.489
He's resting.

00:04:41.156 --> 00:04:42.324
I'm, I'm so sorry that...

00:04:43.575 --> 00:04:45.327
that must be
really disappointing.

00:04:45.953 --> 00:04:47.120
Is there anything I can--

00:04:47.204 --> 00:04:49.122
-I can stay for a while--
-Hey, man.

00:04:49.206 --> 00:04:50.415
This isn't a good time.

00:04:50.999 --> 00:04:54.294
I'll see you guys tomorrow
and Winter Fest, right?

00:04:56.421 --> 00:04:57.256
Course.

00:04:58.131 --> 00:04:59.550
Text me
if you need anything.

00:05:06.473 --> 00:05:08.225
Maybe it's just gonna
take some time.

00:05:08.809 --> 00:05:10.269
So, what're you doing today?

00:05:10.352 --> 00:05:12.062
Did you volunteer
to work a booth?

00:05:12.145 --> 00:05:13.355
No, no. I actually thought

00:05:13.438 --> 00:05:14.982
I'd come
and keep you company.

00:05:15.065 --> 00:05:17.734
Maybe get my face painted
if there's not an age limit.

00:05:17.818 --> 00:05:19.319
How about
this little lobster claw

00:05:19.403 --> 00:05:21.238
in honour of my boy,
Nephropida.

00:05:40.757 --> 00:05:42.217
This'll only hurt a little.

00:05:45.179 --> 00:05:48.348
If Erin knew,
then they know too.

00:05:49.057 --> 00:05:51.393
Really think if Kinsey knew
she'd sit across from me

00:05:51.476 --> 00:05:53.228
painting butterflies
all day?

00:05:53.312 --> 00:05:55.230
Well, then explain Duncan.

00:05:55.814 --> 00:05:57.983
I saw Duncan use
the Anywhere key.

00:05:58.066 --> 00:05:59.359
He remembers magic.

00:06:01.486 --> 00:06:03.280
Let's face it,
you got played.

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:06.450
Don't you think Amanda
should take

00:06:06.533 --> 00:06:07.910
Nephropida's hand here?

00:06:07.993 --> 00:06:10.204
Uh... yeah. I like that.

00:06:12.331 --> 00:06:13.207
Yeah, sure.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:33.018
-You bitch!
-Stop!

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:34.645
Tyler!

00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:46.323
Guess we're doing this
the hard way.

00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:47.241
Stop!

00:06:54.581 --> 00:06:56.458
-Hey, Kins.
-What do you want from me?

00:06:57.709 --> 00:06:58.585
Isn't that obvious?

00:07:01.046 --> 00:07:02.089
I want you to join me.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:05.759
I will never chose
to be with you.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:07.678
Or be like you!

00:07:10.514 --> 00:07:12.432
Fine.
Then I'll kill your mum.

00:07:14.685 --> 00:07:15.519
Yeah, Nina.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:18.689
And just to be clear,
not turn her...

00:07:21.942 --> 00:07:22.776
I mean kill her.

00:07:24.862 --> 00:07:25.696
Hey.

00:07:26.321 --> 00:07:27.155
Hey.

00:07:32.119 --> 00:07:33.036
If I'm being honest,

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.872
I didn't expect you
to show up.

00:07:36.248 --> 00:07:37.082
Here I am.

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.751
You want me
to want to join you,

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.295
voluntarily.

00:07:42.671 --> 00:07:43.755
But you've trapped me.

00:07:44.673 --> 00:07:46.842
You've made it so I don't
have any other choice.

00:07:46.925 --> 00:07:49.803
Kinsey. Whatever I am,
I still have a human soul.

00:07:50.637 --> 00:07:51.638
I meant what I said.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:54.933
You seriously think
you love me?

00:07:56.602 --> 00:07:57.519
If I didn't,

00:07:59.104 --> 00:08:00.564
you'd already be dead

00:08:00.647 --> 00:08:02.107
That's never gonna happen.

00:08:04.359 --> 00:08:05.485
Because I realised

00:08:05.569 --> 00:08:07.237
one thing
I can still control

00:08:09.364 --> 00:08:10.365
is my own fate.

00:08:28.133 --> 00:08:29.843
Are you kidding me!

00:08:42.481 --> 00:08:44.900
Why couldn't you
just done what I wanted?

00:08:48.946 --> 00:08:51.281
Goodbye. Kinsey.

00:09:03.794 --> 00:09:04.628
Kinsey!

00:09:25.983 --> 00:09:28.235
Holy shit,

00:09:28.318 --> 00:09:29.778
You made it! I can't even...

